<http://data.silknow.org/object/621a62c9-f091-3907-acfb-7894e9b05274/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Furnishing fabric of woven silk. Buff ground with a floral pattern in pink, brick red, green, yellow and brown. There is a formal bunch of three flowers tied with a ribbon in the centre and other bunches tied on each side.\n\nLampas or tissue with gros de tours ground and the pattern bound in 3/1 twill. The colours are arranged in changes. Point repeat. Woven in coarse tabby. The material may have once formed part of a dress."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/621a62c9-f091-3907-acfb-7894e9b05274> .

